    "text": "By Hal Scheurich ,\n6 hours ago ROBERTSDALE, Ala. (WALA) - About 90 % of holiday travelers will be going by vehicle and that number is expected to be about 73 million according to AAA. Baldwin County saw its share of that traffic, many stopping at Buc-ee’s Beach Express for a break from the road. By... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
